| 能力 | 教程 | 查询参考 | 实际例子 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 变量、函数和条件 | [原生正文](../writing/markdoc.mdoc#use:markdoc:variables) | [上下文](markdoc-native.mdoc#ref:markdoc-context) | [同源效果](../writing/markdoc.mdoc#use:markdoc:effect) |
| 注解、原生表格和围栏 | [节点属性](../writing/markdoc.mdoc#use:markdoc:annotations) | [节点](markdoc-native.mdoc#ref:markdoc-native-nodes) | [表格和围栏](../writing/markdoc.mdoc#use:markdoc:effect) |
| partial、局部变量和来源 | [复用片段](../writing/markdoc-reuse.mdoc#use:markdoc:partials) | [标签](markdoc-native.mdoc#ref:markdoc-native-tags) | [两份独立片段](../writing/markdoc.mdoc#use:markdoc:effect) |
| Frontmatter、注释、Schema 和 slot | [按需配置](../writing/markdoc-reuse.mdoc#use:markdoc-reuse) | [原生范围](markdoc-native.mdoc#ref:markdoc-native) | [实际配置和效果](../writing/markdoc.mdoc#use:markdoc:effect) |

{% /section %}

