| 接线与完整多端点 | [接线](../rendering/diagrams/wiring.mdoc#use:wiring) | [Connection](ir.mdoc#ref:connections) | [三端点](../rendering/diagrams/wiring.mdoc#use:wiring) |
| 接口独立合并与展开 | [接口](../rendering/diagrams/interfaces.mdoc#use:interface-overview) | [接口身份](graph.mdoc#ref:interfaces) | [多接口](../rendering/diagrams/graph-options.mdoc#use:interface-multiple) |
