| 完整与当前视图 SVG | [接口](../rendering/diagrams/interfaces.mdoc#use:interface-overview) | [输出范围](graph.mdoc#ref:interfaces) | [可操作接口图](../rendering/diagrams/interfaces.mdoc#use:interface-overview) |
